{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47768","headline":"踏歌 · 蓝采和","name":"踏歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"踏歌踏歌蓝采和，世界能几何。\n红颜三春树，流年一掷梭。\n古人混混去不返，今人纷纷来更多。\n朝骑鸾凤到碧落，暮见桑田生白波。\n长景明晖在空际，金银宫阙高嵯峨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蓝采和","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}